# Day 20 - AI Face Puzzle Game | Claude AI Interactive Web Application

## Overview

Today I built an **AI-powered Face Puzzle Game** using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript** with the help of **Claude AI**.

The application captures a user's face using the device webcam and instantly converts the image into a playable puzzle with multiple difficulty levels. It also includes real-time gameplay statistics, drag-and-drop interactions, touch support, and a local leaderboard.

---

# Objective

Build a complete browser-based puzzle game that combines:

* Webcam Integration
* Image Processing
* Puzzle Generation
* Interactive Gameplay
* Performance Tracking

---

# Features

## 📷 Live Camera Access

* Webcam permission using MediaDevices API
* Live camera preview
* Capture photo directly from browser

---

## 🧩 Puzzle Generation

After capturing a photo, users can select:

* 3×3 (Easy)
* 4×4 (Medium)
* 5×5 (Hard)

The captured image is automatically divided into puzzle pieces and shuffled for gameplay.

---

## 🎮 Interactive Gameplay

* Drag & Drop Support
* Touch Controls for Mobile Devices
* Tile Highlighting
* Correct Position Indicators
* Smooth Piece Swapping

---

## ⏱ Game Statistics

The game tracks:

* Live Timer
* Move Counter
* Correct Pieces
* Selected Difficulty

---

## 🏆 Results & Leaderboard

After completing the puzzle, the application displays:

* Final Completion Time
* Total Moves
* Difficulty Level
* Best Scores

Leaderboard data is stored using **Local Storage**, allowing results to persist across sessions.

---

## 🎨 User Experience

* Responsive Design
* Modern UI
* Smooth Animations
* Retake Photo Option
* Play Again Button
* Capture New Photo
* Mobile-Friendly Layout

