# Key Learnings

## 1. AI Can Generate Complete Interactive Applications

Claude AI can build fully functional browser-based games with advanced features using a single structured prompt.

---

## 2. HTML5 APIs Enable Powerful Web Experiences

Using the **MediaDevices API** and **Canvas API**, modern browsers can support real-time camera access and image manipulation without external software.

---

## 3. Prompt Quality Directly Impacts Application Quality

Providing detailed and structured prompts results in richer functionality and a more polished user experience.

---

## 4. Responsive Design Is Essential

Building for both desktop and mobile ensures accessibility and usability across different devices.

---

# Gameplay Flow

1. Open the application
2. Allow webcam access
3. Capture your photo
4. Select puzzle difficulty
5. Solve the puzzle using drag-and-drop or touch controls
6. View completion statistics
7. Save your best score to the leaderboard

